From 8bfe563d0f4772cf92602e9af5db7b5a5125cc56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cool <bilibili@att.net>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:02:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] nouveau: preserve NVK Android and nvgpu integration

Capture local Android hardware-buffer, image, queue and memory changes,
NIL tiling/modifier changes, and the additional nvgpu backend and UAPI.
The Spark kernel path uses Nouveau; the nvgpu backend is preserved as part
of the current source delta and is not separately hardware-validated.

