index 21475984595b7ecb61f376bc92e8ec7560dd5d64..cf826751b2b74294955209a23722a3c3f9c3d298 100644
--- a/docs/drivers/nvk.rst
+++ b/docs/drivers/nvk.rst
@@ -96,6 +96,11 @@ specific to NVK:
    poorly tested or completely broken.  This is intended for developer use
    only.
 
+.. envar:: NVK_ON_NVGPU
+
+   If defiend to ``1`` or ``true``, this will enable enumeration on the nvgpu
